      the filters. There's no separate failed-only state that could disagree with the checkboxes. I'm not changing how
      failed rows look; that's still to be decided with Security.
    - [1mEvent type.[0m A fieldset with nine checkboxes, all ticked by default. The labels come from the fixed list in
      NOTES.md, not from the data.
