      before the start date, it shows the guideline [38;5;153mdate_order[39m message.
    - [1mButtons.[0m One primary "Apply filters" submit (Enter also applies) and a secondary "Clear filters". Changing a field
      never filters by itself, as WCAG 3.2.2 requires.
